{{/* English bot copy: a plain translation of id.tmpl with identical
template names, data fields and separators. Cancel keywords stay
parser-recognised ("cancel", "yes", "no"), so the examples here are
answerable. The voice mirrors id.tmpl: warm and professional, first
person, no slang. Lead-ins map "Sip," → "Done,", "Oke," → "Okay,",
"Hmm," → "Hmm,", "Aduh," → "Sorry,". No exclamation marks, no emoji. */}}

{{/* Confirmations never quote a balance — see id.tmpl. Safe-to-Spend and
runway appear only in the rituals the user asks for. */}}

{{define "recorded_one" -}}
Done, recorded: {{.Amount}} · {{.Merchant}}{{if .Note}} · {{.Note}}{{end}} · {{.Category}} · {{.Source}}{{if .Backdated}} · {{.Date}}{{end}}
{{- end}}

{{define "recorded_income" -}}
Done, {{.Amount}} in · {{.Merchant}} · to {{.Source}}{{if .Backdated}} · {{.Date}}{{end}}
{{- end}}

{{define "recorded_transfer" -}}
Done, moved {{.Amount}} · {{.Source}} → {{.Destination}}{{if .Backdated}} · {{.Date}}{{end}}
{{- end}}

{{define "recorded_many" -}}
Done, {{len .Items}} transactions recorded:
{{range .Items}}{{.N}}. {{.Amount}} · {{.Merchant}}{{if .Note}} · {{.Note}}{{end}} · {{.Category}} · {{.Source}}
{{end}}If something is off, reply "cancel" to delete all or "cancel 2" for number 2.
{{- end}}

{{define "capture_incomplete" -}}
Sorry, this capture is incomplete. These items were recorded:
{{range .Items}}{{.N}}. {{.Amount}} · {{.Merchant}}
{{end}}If needed, reply "cancel" to undo the recorded items or "cancel 1" for number 1.
{{- end}}

{{define "uncategorized" -}}
no category yet
{{- end}}

{{define "hold_saved" -}}
I'm holding this for now: {{.Summary}}
{{.Question}}
{{- end}}

{{define "hold_to_dashboard" -}}
I saved it as a draft for now, finish it in the dashboard.
{{- end}}

{{define "q_amount" -}}
How much was it?
{{- end}}

{{define "q_amount_roles" -}}
Two numbers here — which one was paid, which one is the change? Example: "pay 50k change 25k".
{{- end}}

{{define "q_source" -}}
Which source did you pay with? {{join .Sources " / "}}
{{- end}}

{{define "q_destination" -}}
Where should it move to? {{join .Sources " / "}}
{{- end}}

{{define "q_refund_target" -}}
Refund for {{.Merchant}} {{.Amount}} ({{.Date}}), right? Reply yes/no.
{{- end}}

{{define "refund_done" -}}
Okay, the {{.Merchant}} {{.Amount}} refund is back in {{.Source}}.
{{- end}}

{{define "refund_no_target" -}}
I can't find a {{.Merchant}} transaction in the last 30 days. Have a look in the dashboard.
{{- end}}

{{define "batal_done" -}}
Okay, I cancelled {{len .Items}} transactions:
{{range .Items}}{{.N}}. {{.Amount}} · {{.Merchant}}
{{end}}
{{- end}}

{{define "batal_nothing" -}}
There's nothing from chat I can cancel. Delete it in the dashboard.
{{- end}}

{{define "batal_bad_index" -}}
Number {{.N}} isn't there — the last batch only has {{.Count}} items.
{{- end}}

{{define "discarded" -}}
Okay, discarded. Nothing was written.
{{- end}}

{{define "no_open_question" -}}
Nothing is waiting for an answer.
{{- end}}

{{/* Sent whenever a message arrives that does not settle the open
draft — see id.tmpl. */}}
{{define "open_question_reminder" -}}
I'm still waiting on an answer for: {{.Summary}}. Reply "yes"/"no", name the source, or fix the date or amount.
{{- end}}

{{define "unknown" -}}
Hmm, I didn't catch that. To record a spend, type something like "coffee 25k with gopay"; for a summary, type "recap"; to correct something, "that category food".
{{- end}}

{{define "corrected" -}}
{{if eq .Type "transfer"}}Okay, fixed: moved {{.Amount}} · {{.Source}} → {{.Destination}}{{else}}Okay, fixed: {{.Amount}} · {{.Merchant}} · {{.Category}} · {{.Source}}{{end}}{{if .Backdated}} · {{.Date}}{{end}}
{{- end}}

{{define "correct_nothing" -}}
There's no chat transaction I can change yet. Change it in the dashboard.
{{- end}}

{{define "correct_failed" -}}
I can't change {{.Field}} on that transaction from chat. Change it in the dashboard.
{{- end}}

{{/* Balances are quoted only here — see id.tmpl. */}}
{{define "balance_one" -}}
{{.Source}}: {{.Balance}}
{{- end}}

{{define "balance_all" -}}
{{range .Items}}{{.Source}}: {{.Balance}}
{{end}}Safe-to-Spend {{.Sts}}
{{- end}}

{{define "unsupported_media" -}}
Send it as a photo — I can't read video, audio or documents.
{{- end}}

{{/* Receipt photos — see id.tmpl. A photo always parks as a draft. */}}

{{define "photo_issue" -}}
{{if eq . "blur"}}blurry{{else if eq . "glare"}}washed out by glare{{else if eq . "too_small"}}too small{{else if eq . "cropped"}}cut off{{else if eq . "download"}}impossible to download{{else}}unreadable{{end}}
{{- end}}

{{define "photo_unreadable" -}}
The photo is {{template "photo_issue" .Issue}}, so I can't trust the digits. Retake it closer, flat and well lit.
{{- end}}

{{define "photo_no_total" -}}
I can't see the TOTAL line yet. Send the bottom of the receipt — the part with the total is enough.
{{- end}}

{{define "photo_not_receipt" -}}
Hmm, that doesn't look like a receipt or payment proof. Type the amount if you want me to record it.
{{- end}}

{{define "photo_vision_down" -}}
I can't see photos right now, the receipt reader is having trouble. Try again later, or type the amount.
{{- end}}

{{define "photo_statement" -}}
I can't read statements or bills that hold many transactions. Send the receipts one at a time.
{{- end}}

{{define "photo_currency" -}}
I don't support {{.Currency}} yet, only Rupiah for now.
{{- end}}

{{define "photo_too_large" -}}
That photo is too large. Send it as a regular photo (not HD/document).
{{- end}}

{{define "photo_duplicate" -}}
You already sent this photo: {{.Summary}}
{{- end}}

{{define "photo_llm_off" -}}
Receipt reading is off right now. Just type the amount.
{{- end}}

{{define "receipt_summary" -}}
{{if .Duplicate}}Possible duplicate · {{end}}{{if .Payment}}Payment proof {{.Merchant}} · {{.Total}}{{else}}Receipt {{.Merchant}} · {{.Date}} · {{.N}} items · {{.Total}}{{end}}{{if .Inconsistent}} · breakdown inconsistent{{end}}
{{- end}}

{{/* The Source line says how the Source was decided — see id.tmpl. */}}
{{define "receipt_hold" -}}
{{.Summary}}
{{range .Items}}• {{.Name}} {{.Amount}}{{if .Category}} · {{.Category}}{{end}}
{{end}}{{if gt .More 0}}…and {{.More}} more
{{end}}{{if .AskSource}}Which source paid? {{join .Sources " / "}}{{else}}Paid from {{.Source}}{{if or (eq .Basis "memory") (eq .Basis "default")}} (usually).{{else if eq .Basis "guess"}}?{{else}}.{{end}}
Reply "yes" if that looks right, "no" to discard. Want a different source or category? Just say so.{{end}}
{{- end}}

{{define "receipt_recorded" -}}
Done, {{.N}} lines from {{.Merchant}} recorded · {{.Total}} from {{.Source}}. Type "cancel" if it's wrong.
{{- end}}

{{/* One message may change several things about the draft at once;
.Change is the " · "-join of the fragments below. */}}
{{define "receipt_updated" -}}
Okay, {{.Change}}. Does that look right? Reply yes/no.
{{- end}}

{{define "receipt_need_source" -}}
Which source paid for it? {{join .Sources " / "}}
{{- end}}

{{define "receipt_default_learned" -}}
I'll take the next receipt as {{.Source}} unless it says otherwise — you can change that in Settings.
{{- end}}

{{define "receipt_split_mismatch" -}}
Hmm, the parts don't add up: {{.Parts}} ≠ {{.Total}}. Try again.
{{- end}}

{{define "receipt_split_unknown_source" -}}
I don't know that source. The options are: {{join .Sources " / "}}
{{- end}}

{{define "receipt_change_source" -}}
from {{.Source}}
{{- end}}

{{define "receipt_change_split" -}}
{{range $i, $p := .Payments}}{{if $i}} · {{end}}{{$p.Source}} {{$p.Amount}}{{end}}
{{- end}}

{{define "receipt_change_category" -}}
category {{.Category}}
{{- end}}

{{define "receipt_change_merchant" -}}
merchant {{.Merchant}}
{{- end}}

{{define "receipt_change_date" -}}
date {{.Date}}
{{- end}}

{{define "receipt_change_note" -}}
note {{.Note}}
{{- end}}

{{define "date_future" -}}
I can't record a future date — send it again when it happens.
{{- end}}

{{define "date_too_old" -}}
That's over a year back — please add it from the dashboard.
{{- end}}

{{define "rekap_hari" -}}
You spent {{.Spent}} today · Safe-to-Spend {{.Sts}} · reserved tomorrow {{.ReservedTomorrow}} · {{.Uncategorized}} uncategorised{{if .DueTomorrow}} · due tomorrow: {{join .DueTomorrow ", "}}{{end}}{{if .Overdue}} · {{.Overdue}} overdue{{end}}{{if .Verdict}}
{{.Verdict}}{{end}}
{{- end}}

{{define "rekap_minggu" -}}
You spent {{.Spent}} this week ({{.Delta}} vs last week)
Days that stood out: {{if .AnomalyDays}}{{join .AnomalyDays ", "}}{{else}}none{{end}}
{{.Uncategorized}} uncategorised
Top: {{range $i, $t := .Top}}{{if $i}} · {{end}}{{$t.Name}} {{$t.Amount}}{{end}}{{if .Verdict}}
{{.Verdict}}{{end}}
{{- end}}

{{define "error_generic" -}}
Sorry, something broke on my side. Try again shortly.
{{- end}}

{{define "invite_sent" -}}
You've been invited to catet. Sign up here (valid 7 days): {{.URL}}
If you receive this link again, use the newest one.
{{- end}}

{{define "bill_reminder" -}}
Bill reminder
{{- if .Overdue}}
Overdue: {{join .Overdue ", "}}{{end}}
{{- if .Today}}
Today: {{join .Today ", "}}{{end}}
{{- if .Tomorrow}}
Tomorrow: {{join .Tomorrow ", "}}{{end}}
{{- if .InThree}}
In 3 days: {{join .InThree ", "}}{{end}}
Reply *lunas <amount>* once paid.
{{- end}}

{{define "lunas_none" -}}
No matching bill.
{{- end}}

{{define "lunas_choose" -}}
Which bill?
{{range .Items}}{{.}}
{{end}}Reply with the number.
{{- end}}

{{define "lunas_amount" -}}
How much for {{.Name}}?
{{- end}}

{{define "lunas_source" -}}
{{.Name}} has no linked source. Which one paid? {{join .Sources " · "}}
{{- end}}

{{define "lunas_done" -}}
Paid: {{.Name}} {{.Amount}}. Next {{.Next}}.
{{- end}}

{{define "lunas_completed" -}}
done
{{- end}}
